repository-code: 'https://github.com/mariolpantunes/pyBlindOpt'
url: 'https://mariolpantunes.github.io/pyBlindOpt/'
abstract: >-
  A pure-Python library of derivative-free optimization algorithms — random
  search, hill climbing, simulated annealing, genetic algorithms, differential
  evolution with adaptive and ensemble variants, particle swarm, grey wolf,
  artificial bee colony, firefly, Harris hawks, cuckoo search and honey badger
  — together with OBLESA, an initializer that combines opposition-based
  learning with empty-space search.
keywords:
  - optimization
  - derivative-free
  - metaheuristics
  - evolutionary-computation
  - differential-evolution
  - opposition-based-learning
